        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bearly Brave</strong> is a 2D roguelike deck-building game set in a deceptively charming toy shop, where the cutest teddy bears must compete to determine their placement on the shelves—and thus their likelihood to be taken to their forever home. Hone your strategy by stacking cards, landing insane combos, and purchasing ability upgrades, all to reach new damage highs with crazy one-shot numbers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll take on the role of <strong>Toby</strong>, a gentle bear forced into this brutal competition by the sadistic Boris. Mixing turn-based strategy with fast-paced deck-building, <strong>Bearly Brave</strong> challenges you to craft unique builds in Toby’s fight to escape the sinister clutches of the toy shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/2359a20d98fda223508b97239243bcf8.avif?t=1777596781\" width=616 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/94d7f2b9a98354476816eddac0662c99.poster.avif?t=1777596781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/94d7f2b9a98354476816eddac0662c99.webm?t=1777596781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/94d7f2b9a98354476816eddac0662c99.mp4?t=1777596781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Toby with a wide range of tools and abilities to overcome his foes. Utilize <strong>Weapon Effects</strong>, <strong>Skill Cards</strong>, <strong>Candies</strong>, <strong>Boss Rewards</strong>, and <strong>Patches</strong> to deal absurd amounts of damage and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/a63febe64cc23444dae4e1d7b89034e2.avif?t=1777596781\" width=616 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/5ef28cf26caec623983b0b08f07145b3.poster.avif?t=1777596781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/5ef28cf26caec623983b0b08f07145b3.webm?t=1777596781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/5ef28cf26caec623983b0b08f07145b3.mp4?t=1777596781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tournament in <strong>Bearly Brave</strong> is a new challenge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a <strong>different set of enemies</strong> in each run, keeping battles fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>unique rewards</strong> with every victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain <strong>powerful cards</strong> from defeated opponents to create broken, game-changing builds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/9383e4a05fd4c3b6a37065a957548adb.avif?t=1777596781\" width=616 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/c80d96d5eb813348e0827fd45a8cab1f.poster.avif?t=1777596781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/c80d96d5eb813348e0827fd45a8cab1f.webm?t=1777596781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/c80d96d5eb813348e0827fd45a8cab1f.mp4?t=1777596781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimble, the enigmatic shopkeeper, offers everything you need to customize your deck and enhance your strategy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase <strong>Weapons</strong>, <strong>Skill Cards</strong>, <strong>Candies</strong>, and <strong>Patches</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong>, <strong>Banish</strong>, <strong>Clone</strong>, or <strong>Enhance your cards</strong> with new effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with endless combinations to create your perfect build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490280/extras/c1f47939a41734af16c5ae04406e6e25.avif?t=1777596781\" width=616 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 Skill Cards</strong> to craft unique strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Weapon Cards</strong> with over <strong>50 powerful effects</strong> to combo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>110+ Unique Patches</strong> to customize your teddy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Consumable Candies</strong> for powerful, temporary boosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 Enemies and 14 Bosses</strong>, each with unique abilities and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 Rewards</strong> to discover as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>45 Unlockable Items</strong> to keep gameplay fresh and rewarding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> for infinite replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Difficulty Levels</strong> and <strong>10 Starting Decks</strong>, offering endless combinations and playstyles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to lead Toby through this nightmarish tournament and fight for freedom? <br><strong>Bearly Brave</strong> is a world of endless strategy, charm, and challenges waiting for you to conquer.</p>",
